      "mergedPostDetails": "I use custom bindings with my index on the live build so i can use my plaspace mover on the B button and have the action menu sepparatly assigned to a different button so that i don't open the action menu constantly when i moved my playspace.\n\nOnly a few problems i've noticed so far:\n\nI was able to put the action menu on a different button but I was not able to remove it from the B button without also removing the quick menu from the B button.\n\nit seems like the 'menu' binding in the global tab of the bindings menu causes this behaviour because it doesn't keep/have a sepparation between the quick menu and action menu.\n\nand there is also not a Quick_Menu binding.\n\nThis means I cannot have the quick menu and the action menu on sepparate buttons from each other like in the live build which is really annoying.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "1482 Quick/Action Menu bindings not sepperatly assignable/removable",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "66a5187b9d2282cf8076e5c7",
